  "abstract": "Keep the SOTA Fourier LN + learnable \u03b3 intact; add a tiny label-free residual gate r[b,t] from 4-step input stats via a 2-layer MLP, scaled \u00b17%, to softly modulate horizon emphasis per input. Goal: recover >2e\u22125 mean MAE gain on hard conditions without labels.",
